# Schematic — Plant Monitor

This folder contains the KiCad schematic for the Plant Monitor.

## Purpose

The schematic defines how the ESP32, sensors, OLED display, LEDs, and power connections are connected.

## Planned Connections

| Component            | Connection                   |
| -------------------- | ---------------------------- |
| BME280               | I²C                          |
| OLED display         | I²C                          |
| Soil-moisture sensor | Analog input, planned GPIO34 |
| Green LED            | GPIO25 through a resistor    |
| Red LED              | GPIO26 through a resistor    |
| Sensors and display  | 3.3 V supply                 |
| All components       | Common GND                   |

The BME280 and OLED are planned to share the I²C bus using SDA and SCL.

## Files

* `PlantMonitor.kicad_sch` — KiCad schematic source file

